<%- include('header') %>
<h1>Import / Export</h1>
<p>Upload/paste → preview → resolve lane choices → review → explicit commit. Each source can be committed once. Preview never imports to SharePoint.</p>
<p>Current Sales App Export and legacy Call Tracker v2 use separate import sources. The legacy Legend tab is ignored and its named fictional sample is skipped. Prospects default to Alanna; commercial service remains unset when absent from the source.</p>
<div class="row"><a href="/export/pipeline">Export full staging pipeline CSV</a><a href="/export/weekly">Export weekly CSV</a></div>
<p>The full staging export includes current services, structured migration fields and source history. It is not a legacy Call Tracker file.</p>
<% for(const [kind,columns] of Object.entries(headers)){ %><details><summary><%= importNames[kind] %> — exact header</summary><pre><%= columns.map(x=>'"'+x+'"').join(',') %></pre></details><% } %>
<% if(preview){ %>
<section class="card"><h2><%= preview.kind==='current_sales'?'Current Sales App export detected':importNames[preview.kind] %> — <%= preview.rows.length %> <%= preview.kind==='weekly'?'weeks':'prospects' %></h2>
<% if(preview.ignored){ %><p>Legend ignored. No records will be imported.</p><% } %>
<% if(preview.skipped){ %><p>Fictional sample rows skipped: <%= preview.skipped %></p><% } %>
<% if(preview.kind==='current_sales'){ %><p>Contacted, Follow-Up and Nurture map conservatively to Prospecting. Source stage, status and scheduling fields are preserved. Technical Discovery requires a lane decision below. No Likely Service is inferred.</p><% } %>
<% if(preview.needsLanes){ %>
<form method="post" action="/import/review"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
<p>Choose each technical row’s workflow lane explicitly. No lane is inferred from notes, old tier, or commercial service.</p>
<% for(const [i,row] of preview.data.entries()){if(needsLane(row)){ %>
<label for="lane_<%= i %>"><%= row.business_name %> / <%= row.contact_name %> — <%= row.legacy_stage||row.stage %></label>
<select id="lane_<%= i %>" name="lane_<%= i %>" required><option value="">Choose lane…</option><option value="Business IT Integration">BII — map to Discovery</option><option value="Managed IT">Managed IT — keep Technical Assessment</option></select>
<% }} %><button>Review mapped rows</button></form><% } %>
<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><% for(const h of preview.displayHeaders){ %><th><%= h %></th><% } %></tr></thead><tbody>
<% for(const row of preview.rows){ %><tr><% for(const value of row){ %><td><%= value %></td><% } %></tr><% } %>
</tbody></table></div>
<% if(['pipeline','current_sales'].includes(preview.kind)){ %><details><summary>Full preserved details for review</summary><% for(const row of preview.data){ %><article class="card"><h3><%= row.business_name %></h3><% for(const [key,value] of Object.entries(row)){ %><p class="preserve-lines"><strong><%= key %>:</strong> <%= value===null?'Unset':value %></p><% } %></article><% } %></details><% } %>
<form method="post" action="/import/commit"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button <%= preview.needsLanes||!preview.rows.length?'disabled':'' %>>Commit these rows</button></form>
</section><% } %>
<form method="post" action="/import/preview" class="card"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
<label for="import-kind">Format</label><select name="kind" id="import-kind"><option value="auto">Detect exact header automatically</option><% for(const [kind,label] of Object.entries(importNames)){ %><option value="<%= kind %>"><%= label %></option><% } %></select>
<label for="csv-file">CSV file</label><input id="csv-file" type="file" accept=".csv,text/csv"><label for="csv-content">CSV contents</label><textarea id="csv-content" name="csv" rows="12" required></textarea><button>Preview import</button></form>
<%- include('footer') %>
